-- The other family-table entry with a random second operand: a product of two
-- log-normals is log-normal. Pins that 'mult' of two PLogNormals is inlined the
-- same way 'plus' of two PNormals is (task
-- unwitnessed-gaussian-let-chain-admitted-but-crashes).
main = let x = exp Normal in let y = x * exp Normal in y
